name: Real scope variant stays unaccepted with uncovered root and exhausted allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/operator-home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART inspect
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES · r2 | real-proposal
expect: 496/602 files
expect: Proposal context: saved revision tmr_b8b5f79cd3ab42f3a5184a8d96084030
expect-not: ACCEPTED SCOPES
ask: Does the real proposal show its model, exact saved architecture revision, bounded input, component groups and unaccepted state without implying complete source understanding or approved scan jobs?
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Shared: | shared-context
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 20 Uncovered 1 · excluded 0 · overlap 0 | uncovered-category
keys: Right Down
require-live-snap: 20 File: workspace.json | uncovered-root-file
resize: 160x48
live-snap: root-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: root-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: root-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: root-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: root-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: root-details-40x12
ask: Across six sizes, is workspace.json visibly uncovered with readable controls, while shared context stays separate from discovery and no scope is accepted?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART inspected
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/read-allowance.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Calls committed: 2/2 · remaining: 0 | spent-allowance
expect: Unresolved calls: 0
expect: dollar ceiling: not enforced
ask: Does allowance inspection preserve the earlier paid failure and the successful variant as two spent requests, with no remaining calls or enforced dollar ceiling?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART accounting
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/operator-home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES · r2 | recovered-proposal
expect: Proposal context: saved revision tmr_b8b5f79cd3ab42f3a5184a8d96084030
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Right Down
require-live-snap: 20 File: workspace.json | recovered-uncovered-root
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the same unaccepted real proposal, uncovered root, inactive architecture and exhausted allowance with no new work or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
